--- !u!114 &342451335
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 342451333}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e910c0f40805244793fcdcde0d5e0c3, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialMessages:
  - Ok Squirt if you are serious about wanting to take on the mines I'll help ya
    out. Head right.
  - Alright to break rocks you're gonna need to use yer bombs.These ain't toys though,
    they'll hurt ya if ya don't pay attention. Place one next to the rock and then
    get outta there!
  - Hold on squirt! See that shiny rock, it has some gems in it. I want ya to use
    ya pickaxe on it. If ya blow it up with a bomb, ya won't get nothing.
  - Ya can't destroy these walls, they're too thick. Try using yer bombs and yer
    pickaxe to get through the gaps.
  - Watch out, enemies up ahead. Enemies come in a lotta shapes and sizes but most
    ain't tough enough to survive a bomb. And don't touch em!
  - Dash over those gaps there. Try not to fall off now.
  - These tunnels will take ya to further sections of the mines. Go up and interact
    with it.
  - To get to the next level of the mines ya need to find the tunnel. Its usually
    under a rock so get going. Good luck squirt!
  tutorialAlternateMessages:
  - 
  - 
  - NO ya idiot! Don't blow the shiny ones up, ya won't get nothing outta them. Use
    your pickaxe squirt.
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
  - 
